{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2025-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1754006400, "end_date": 1754611199, "month_true_total": 252, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:56:52 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "201668063", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063136867", "personaname": "Luscinia", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Luscinia0076/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 5161, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4872, "last_played": 1782190692, "avatar": "6557fa13278a3aa370525abc0b0fb68f96e1bf11"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was sceptical at first after being gifted this, but wow.\nThe gameplay was spectacular, the variety in builds was unexpected, and there's clearly much more maximisation that I have yet to do.\n\nIf I had to make one major complaint it's that there are severe memory leak issues. From my research, it seems to be an issue with the Orb of Undoing item, and changing your build loadouts. It's most apparent when trying to do Boss Rush. I've done an hour long Boss Rush Gauntlet only for the host player to crash after killing the final boss, losing us the rewards.\n\nOutside of that issue, which can be mostly worked around, the game is amazing. I'm hoping if Remnant 3 comes around, there will be a lot more variety in worlds, as the same three have slowly become a bit repetitive. There's so much content, but confining it to just 3 worlds feels restrictive, this same amount of content could be spread across 6 worlds and give much more variety.", "timestamp_created": 1754607578, "timestamp_updated": 1754607578, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201614632", "author": {"steamid": "76561198858115879", "personaname": "marqui15gotem", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198858115879/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 20772, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20481, "last_played": 1777862520, "avatar": "8cf77fe72a0c46c070d085c8129e53429d0ea599"}, "language": "english", "review": "Slept on", "timestamp_created": 1754541749, "timestamp_updated": 1754541749, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501480162143707275", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201612330", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997855468", "personaname": "HighFive", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/patr1k/", "num_games_owned": 192, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 5890, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4979, "last_played": 1754905846, "avatar": "f5e9873b79edf0ba04241e3c5cbd7c9c68bd7109"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its a gud game:\r\n\r\nA lot of ♥♥♥♥ to farm, a lot of levers to pull to improve your build.\r\nMight require a wiki or two.\r\n\r\nSome negatives though:\r\n\r\nThe story is ambitious and I feel like it tries to tell a tale of a post apocalyptic world filled with lovecraftian horrors. However there is this huge disconnect between the gameplay and the story. \r\nFor instance: In most of the worlds you face a godlike being, your character does a silly quip and then proceeds to curbstomp said godlike being into the ground.", "timestamp_created": 1754537972, "timestamp_updated": 1754537972, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false